From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 05:14:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: phy: apple,atcphy: describe a DisplayPort-only
 T8132 PHY

The J604 (MacBook Pro 14-inch, M4) runs ATC2 without a USB controller:
its ADT names it atc2-dpphy, a fixed DisplayPort PHY behind the HDMI
port. Allow a T8132 PHY to be described with its five banks only (core,
AXI2AF, LIOA, fabric and common configuration), without the USB2 PHY
and PIPE windows; the driver then runs it as a four-lane DisplayPort
PHY, as a T8122 one described without them.

[j604: no upstream commit exists; the five banks are those of the J604
 ADT atc-phy2 reg (measured from the J604 ADT on 2026-11-04).]

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/phy/apple,atcphy.yaml | 22 ++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/apple,atcphy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/apple,atcphy.yaml
index f9b8f79820..eda3abd39e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/apple,atcphy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/apple,atcphy.yaml
@@ -34,7 +34,10 @@ description: >
   USB2 PHY and pipehandler banks. Its SuperSpeed host profile adds separately
   owned core, AXI, LIOA, fabric and common-configuration banks. The intervening
   display crossbar is not part of the PHY resource. SuperSpeed calibration is
-  supplied in banked lists so that no list spans that crossbar.
+  supplied in banked lists so that no list spans that crossbar. A T8132 PHY
+  without a USB controller, such as the one behind the HDMI port of the M4
+  MacBook Pros, is described with these five banks only and is then run as a
+  four-lane DisplayPort PHY.
 
 allOf:
   - $ref: /schemas/usb/usb-switch.yaml#
@@ -74,6 +77,23 @@ allOf:
                 - const: common-config
           required:
             - power-domains
+        - properties:
+            reg:
+              items:
+                - description: DisplayPort PHY core, excluding the display crossbar
+                - description: AXI to Apple Fabric interface controls
+                - description: Local IO address translation controls
+                - description: ATC fabric controls
+                - description: ATC common configuration controls
+            reg-names:
+              items:
+                - const: core
+                - const: axi2af
+                - const: lioa
+                - const: fabric
+                - const: common-config
+          required:
+            - power-domains
     else:
       properties:
         reg:
